OL,3,GNEWSAPeople evacuated after bomb squad
OL,4,Acalled to house
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes have been evacuated after bomb
OL,7,Fdisposal experts were called following
OL,8,Fa discovery at a house in Sheffield.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said a 100m
OL,11,F(328ft) cordon had been put in place
OL,12,Faround the property on Mapplebeck Road
OL,13,Fin High Green following a forensic
OL,14,Fsearch at the scene which had been
OL,15,Fongoing since Friday.
OL,17,FThe force said after a discovery was
OL,18,Fmade earlier, it was "deemed necessary
OL,19,Fto evacuate nearby properties to enable
OL,20,Femergency services and specialists to
OL,21,Fensure safety".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
