OL,3,GNEWSAPeople evacuated after bomb squad
OL,4,Acalled to house
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a 36-year-old woman was
OL,7,Fcharged under the Explosive Substances
OL,8,FAct on Monday, police added.
